      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Ashen Razor",
          "desc": "Basic Attacks and Skill 2 grant EXP when they hit enemy heroes."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Lightning Dash",
          "desc": "Dashes in the target direction."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Chaos Wave",
          "desc": "Unleashes sword energy in the target direction, dealing damage to enemies in its path and slowing them."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Light Awakening",
          "desc": "Awakens and enters Domination Form."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Strong poke damage",
          "Great scaling after building some CDR",
          "Great Dueling and Splitpush potential"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Vulnerable when caught",
          "Difficult hero to master",
          "Low Mobility"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\n\nLi Xin is not the strongest fighter before level 4. Avoid unnecessary fights until you get your form upgrade; then you can start pressuring your lane opponent with Li Xin's long-range harass in Domination Form.\n\n## Teamfights\n\nWith this build, you want to focus on using Domination Form. Position like you are a ranged carry, using your skills and empowered attacks to deal damage. Only dash in when you know you can guarantee a kill.\n\n## Tips and Tricks\n\nFocus on using Domination Form for long-range poke from your skills and empowered attacks\nYou do not need to use all 4 charges of Blade Flurry. 1 is enough to get your empowered attack\nSave Righteous Charge for dodging and creating distance"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Mode komando: 1) Li Xin kuat banget ke satu arah tapi lemah dari arah lain, serangan mendadak bikin dia gagal ngisi tenaga. 2) Pas pakai serangan cepet dia gak kebal control, jadi di situ dia tipis. Paksa dia berhenti ngayun pedang. Mode ngamuk: 1) Kuat banget jarak deket tapi dash-nya gampang kebaca, jaga jarak. 2) Jangan ngejar kejauhan kalau gagal bunuh dalam satu serangan, dia bakal pulih dan ngebalikin keadaan."
    },
